### 1. Login do administrador (esperado: 200 com token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@admin.dev","password":"teste"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Cadastrar produto SEM token (esperado: 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/ws/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"POCO X8 Pro Global","brand":"POCO","model":"POCO X8 Pro","currency":"USD","price":395.5}

### 3. Cadastrar produto COM token do admin (esperado: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/ws/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"description":"POCO X8 Pro Global","brand":"POCO","model":"POCO X8 Pro","currency":"USD","price":395.5}

### 4. Cadastrar usuario comum (esperado: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Usuario Comum","email":"user@atitus.edu.br","password":"Teste123"}

### 5. Login do usuario comum (esperado: 200 com token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"user@atitus.edu.br","password":"Teste123"}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 6. Cadastrar produto com token de usuario comum (esperado: 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/ws/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{"description":"Teste Comum","brand":"Teste","model":"Teste","currency":"USD","price":100}

### 7. Rota publica sem token (esperado: 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1?targetCurrency=EUR
